    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "point-1",
      "narration_text": "I caught three bugs in review: a gold box covering the captions, a ground line crossing the divider, and \"centripetal\" mispronounced. The first respelling was worse, so Claude Code generated eight candidates and I chose number six.",
